        "v-khush",
        "v-pareshan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The k-questions",
      "body": "kya (what), kaun (who), kahan (where), kab (when), kaise (how), kyun (why), kitna (how much). Learn them well — every conversation uses them.",
      "examples": [
        "v-kya",
        "v-kahan",
        "v-kaise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Aur",
      "body": "Aur means \"and\", and also \"more\".",
